values ('인터로킹 폼스 (Interlocking Forms)', '필리스 마크 (Phyllis Mark)', '광택 알루미늄 원형 테 안에서 타원형 부재가 매달려 흔들리도록 만든 키네틱 멀티플.', 1975, '광택 알루미늄', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','회전','알루미늄','멀티플','마크']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/003.webp?v=80168837fa', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/003.webp?v=253324be6c', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/003.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/003.txt', NULL, 0.078, 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Uploaded by Ira S. Mark, TTEE, Phyllis Mark Revocable Trust, the trust of the artist''s estate / Estate of Phyllis Mark / CC BY-SA 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%27Interlocking_Forms%27_by_Phyllis_Mark.jpg')
