values ('스윙잉 서클 (Swinging Circle)', '필리스 마크 (Phyllis Mark)', '광택 알루미늄 원형 테 안에 늘어선 곡선 슬랫들이 매달려 흔들리는 키네틱 멀티플.', 1972, '광택 알루미늄', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','회전','알루미늄','멀티플','마크']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/005.webp?v=745a45e55c', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/005.webp?v=7491781b01', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/005.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/005.txt', NULL, 0.048, 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Uploaded by Ira S. Mark, TTEE, Phyllis Mark Revocable Trust, the trust of the artist''s estate. / Estate of Phyllis Mark / CC BY-SA 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%27Swinging_Circle%27_by_Phyllis_Mark.jpg')
