values ('4개 구성요소의 추상 모빌 (Abstract mobile in 4 components)', '폰스 헤인스브룩 (Fons Heijnsbroek)', '온실 천장에 매달린 4개의 은색 곡면 부품으로 이루어진 추상 모빌로, 아주 작은 바람에도 반응해 떠오르고 회전한다.', 2005, '골판지(주름판지)에 알루미늄색 도료', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','모빌','바람','알루미늄','실내설치']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/250.webp?v=126c490739', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/250.webp?v=b6df945899', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/250.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/250.txt', NULL, 0.672, 'CC BY 2.0', 'Fons Heijnsbroek from Amsterdam, The Netherlands / 2005 - ''Abstract mobile in 4 components'', hanging in a greenhouse; free image in public domain / Commons, CC-BY – painter-artist, Fons Heijnsbroek / CC BY 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2005_-_%27Abstract_mobile_in_4_components%27,_hanging_in_a_greenhouse;_free_image_in_public_domain_Commons,_CC-BY_%E2%80%93_painter-artist,_Fons_Heijnsbroek_(27946307116).jpg')
