values ('앤모르픽 초상화 — 찰스 1세 (King Charles I, anamorphic)', '미상 (1821년 조판)', '찰스 1세의 앤모르픽 초상화. 특정 거울이나 각도에서만 정상이미지로 보이는 1821년 조판.', 1821, '앤모르피크 조판 (그림자/왜곡 초상화)', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','앤모르피크','찰스1세','초상화','왜곡']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1044.webp?v=88dcd28cfa', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1044.webp?v=80370c2f6f', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1044.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1044.txt', NULL, 0.248, 'CC BY 4.0', 'https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/obf_images/ef/6f/59f68b271713785e6daf9324f773.jpg Gallery: https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/image/L0076255.html Wellcome Collection gallery (2018-03-30): https://wellcomecollection.org/works/dfy6prvb CC-BY-4.0 / CC BY 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:King_Charles_I;_head_and_shoulders,_anamorphic_representation_Wellcome_L0076255.jpg')
