values ('네온 조각 — 후그 카테리옌 우트레흐트 (Neonsculpture Hoog Catherijne Utrecht)', '미상', '우트레흐트 후그 카테리옌(Hoog Catherijne)에 설치된 네온 조명 조각 작품.', 2012, '네온 조명 조각', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','네온','조각','우트레흐트','네덜란드']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1095.webp?v=0e33300b5c', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1095.webp?v=b8df9bfa95', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1095.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1095.txt', NULL, 0.435, 'CC BY-SA 3.0', 'Brbbl / Own work / CC BY-SA 3.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Neonsculpture_Hoog_Catherijne_Utrecht.JPG')
